  "bodyHash": "0a7713526c6a4675",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ES3EF9b_Ub8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>新增女僕任務：御劍飛行</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c4fbd494-13c6-4215-9644-d08c291df31b.png\" width=\"504\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<p>現在你的女僕會進行御劍飛行並跟隨你。劍的樣式取決於女僕主手所持的物品。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>（與 Armourer's Workshop 模型相容）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_135553a1-2725-45fc-bba1-c4c0291369c5.png\" width=\"507\" height=\"298\"></p>\n<p>當附近有敵人時，女僕會射出三把劍來保護主人。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_772c9ad9-09fb-496d-bceb-1159701fe91c.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"254\"></p>\n<p>當女僕受傷時，她會射出六把劍來保護自己。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0c6034ad-2d97-47c8-ad48-b32e459cafd6.png\" width=\"512\" height=\"277\"></p>\n<p>支援 Geo 模型女僕與原版 Bedrock 模型女僕。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1334387/description_e18358c7-6766-42e6-9c05-94b935e27f0b.png\" width=\"515\" height=\"283\"></p>\n<p>你可以透過設定檔修改劍形物品或啟用劍的發光效果。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1334387/description_46ec3a45-74c8-43a4-b953-8ffeb68166e5.png\" width=\"515\" height=\"199\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>致謝：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tartaricacid/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TartaricAcid</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sagesse32/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SAGESSE32</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
